  "about": {
    "title": "About the EX Hidden Legends set",
    "paragraphs": [
      "Pokémon TCG: EX Hidden Legends is a EX expansion released on 1 June 2004. It has 102 cards: 101 in the main set and 1 secret rare. There are also 92 reverse holos.",
      "Choose what you’re collecting: the <b>Standard set</b> (the 101 main set cards), the <b>Master set</b> (193 cards, adding the reverse holos) or the <b>Grand Master set</b> (all 194 cards, adding the 1 secret rare).",
      "This free checklist lets you tick off the cards you own, count spare copies for trading, see your progress by rarity and plan your binder pages. It works on phones and computers, even offline, and your collection stays on your device."
    ]
  },
